      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "ARKit sets this property when a user first adds an anchor to a session.",
      "ko": "The default value of this property is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "sourceHash": "765d25a07d9f9db44278912ba8659b610987e04b6917921439f815c1ac62d4af",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "In multiuser experiences, use this ID to identify the user that created the anchor.",
      "ko": "다중 사용자 환경에서 이 ID를 사용해 앵커를 생성한 사용자를 식별합니다.",
